  %% notes: {"Fire":"Single choke point for Scheduler/Watcher/Refirer/kicks. LoopDetector halts chain depth >= 3.","RunPlugin":"Per-plugin lock, spawn Deno, supervise stderr, promote, write needs-reindex marker.","Reconciler":"Daemon's index loop. 1Hz tick or SIGHUP. Checks markers, dispatches jobs.","Markers":"Lazy form of Signal. needs-reindex (request) and embed-disabled (state).","RunLog":"ADR 0001: one module, two scopes (global + per-Run).","Status_json":"Event-driven since phase 5. lastUpdated timestamp."}
